OL,3,GNEWSAWater leak temporarily closes
OL,4,Ahospital heart clinics
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water leak at the Royal Infirmary of
OL,7,FEdinburgh has forced the temporary
OL,8,Fclosure of two services which offer
OL,9,Fheart-related diagnostic and treatment
OL,10,Fprocedures.
OL,12,FThe leak resulted in mould being found
OL,13,Fin some non-clinical areas and two
OL,14,Fspecialist vascular procedure centres
OL,15,Fhave been taken out of use while
OL,16,Fremedial work is undertaken.
OL,18,FNHS Lothian said the temporary
OL,19,Freduction of clinical areas may result
OL,20,Fin delays or appointments being
OL,21,Frescheduled in some specialist
OL,22,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
